                    "The context is a pattern Digiday put a frame around on Friday.  Brands used creators heavily all year and then handed the Christmas slate almost entirely to famous faces: John Lewis with Kristin Scott Thomas, SharkNinja with Kevin Hart, David Beckham, Tom Brady and Aryna Sabalenka, Sephora with Seth Rogen, Kay with Colin Jost, Gucci with Mariah Carey, Sports Direct with Nike athletes.",
